# Doubling Season makes two Twins and Mirror Gallery keeps both. Under Hushbringer one dies, which triggers nothing
# ("leaves the battlefield" by dying, the Hushbringer ruling), so the delayed ability is not used up and still watches
# the other Twin through the turns that follow (CR 603.7b, 603.7c). Exiling that Twin then sacrifices Stangg.

